{"version":1,"content":"<p>前TVB藝人吳嘉儀（阿七）與圈外男友「豬仔」Leo於2023年8月結婚，惟新婚僅4個月便曾因「改門鎖密碼」風波鬧上新聞。</p><p>事隔多時，吳嘉儀日前在社交平台連環發文，單方面宣布正辦理離婚手續，並控訴男方長期失業、對其進行家居監視及涉及暴力行為。</p><p>面</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:20:50.361588+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:01:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:14:03.313327+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:14:03.313327+00:00","content_hash":"41c449b0cf819d2f344bf2092f1a75ebc1a1bd99e47e9907239912bc8b885b52","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}